Package: dock-receiver
Name: Dock Receiver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: dock-receiver project
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: firmware (>= 3.0)
Section: Multimedia
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/azarzycki/fidelio
Description: Spotify Connect and AirPlay receiver for a speaker dock
 A headless audio receiver for a jailbroken iPhone OS 3 / iOS 5 device in a speaker
 dock: dock-audiod (the audio arbiter), cspot-ios3 (Spotify Connect), dock-raop
 (AirPlay v1), their launchd jobs and a Wi-Fi keepalive, dock-lockctl, the
 NowPlaying app and its lock-screen plugin. The install scripts migrate a device
 from the hand-installed setup of before B1.17 and keep it restorable:
 dock-receiver-setup check | rollback | cleanup | respring.
 cspot-ios3 is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later, the rest under MIT;
 /usr/share/doc/dock-receiver has the licences and notices.
